<br><br>
<<link [[그렇게 한다|Mine Punishment Creature Feature Finish 3]]>><<set $phase to "take">><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[하지 않는다|Mine Punishment Creature Feature Finish 3]]>><<set $phase to "leave">><</link>>



